│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│  Browse recovery trace ledgers. Each ledger documents file disposition decisions across releases — KEEP, TRANSPLANT, REWRITE, DELETE, REGENERATE, or DEFER — with contributor credit and invariant proof.  │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│  Keyboard Shortcuts                                                                                                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│    ENTER  — Load ledgers / view detail                                                                                                                                                                     │
│    R  — Refresh list                                                                                                                                                                                       │
│    ↑↓  — Navigate / scroll rows                                                                                                                                                                            │
│    ESC  — Back to list / dashboard                                                                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│  Press ? or ESC to close help                                                                                                                                                                              │
